OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as man killed in crash with
OL,4,Aparked vehicle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after another
OL,7,Fman died in a crash with a parked
OL,8,Fvehicle in Leicester.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said a grey
OL,11,FVolkswagen Golf crashed in Chesterfield
OL,12,FRoad just before 05:49 GMT on Saturday.
OL,14,FThe man - one of two occupants in the
OL,15,FGolf - sustained serious injuries and
OL,16,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FAnother man was taken to hospital with
OL,18,Fminor injuries and was discharged after
OL,19,Ftreatment, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
